# Raw, full-resolution 3D render exports from Enscape. These are large
# (often several MB each) and there are thousands of them across the
# project folders -- they are a local working archive, not web assets.
#
# The live site only ever ships:
#   - images/portfolio/  (small, resized covers used by the portfolio page)
#   - a handful of specific images already referenced directly in
#     index.html's hero/intro/about/beliefs/why-us/founder sections,
#     which are explicitly allow-listed below so they stay tracked.
#
# images/portfolio/ is NOT covered by any rule below, so it is tracked
# normally.

images/residential/1/
images/residential/4/

images/residential/2/*
!images/residential/2/BEDROOM 1.jpg
!images/residential/2/kitchen 1.jpg
!images/residential/2/living 6.jpg
!images/residential/2/living room s1.jpg

